- (Explore) What do you like to do for fun? | [if {Timeline_Managment.MinervaInt1_1Hobbies} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	set {Timeline_Managment.MinervaInt1_1_MemCodesLearnt} += 1.0
	Player (Default): "What do you like to do for fun?"
