- (Explore) How long do you think you're going to stay? | [if {Timeline_Managment.MinervaInt1_1Leave}  ==  0.0 and {Timeline_Managment.MinervaInt1_1LeaveAsked} == 0.0]
	Player (Default): "How long do you think you're going to stay for?"
	Minerva (Default): "I'm not too sure. I haven't really had somewhere to stay at all for the past couple of months, so if you'd be willing, id like to stay here for a good while."
