- I'm hungry. It's time for breakfast.
	Player (Default): "Sorry, I know we just started talking, but I'm really hungry. I'm going to make breakfast."
Minerva (Default): "Oh. Yeah, I guess it is about that time, isn't it? I'll let you go then, I've got some of my own."
[i]{Minerva.name} leans over her backpack, rummaging inside for something[/i]
- Offer to make breakfast.
	Player (Happy): "Don't worry about it. I have enough food for both of us."
	Minerva (Default): "Really? Are you sure? You don't have to give me your food, I have my own stockpile."
	Player (Default): "I already said to not worry about it. I have enough for a couple of years at least."
	Minerva (Shock): "A couple of [b]years[/b]!? Where did you get all of that from?"
	Player (Sad): "...I'm actually not sure."
	[i]{Minerva.name} gives you a strange look, but lets it go. You go make breakfast, breaking out some pancake mix you suppose you'd been saving for an occasion like this.[/i]
	set {Minerva.minerva_friendship} += 5.0
- Leave her be.
	[i]You silently leave and make yourself breakfast. It's nothing special, just some canned fruit and some cereal.[/i]
